  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-archive-purge",
      "text": "[English](README.en.md) | **中文**\n\n给 DeepSeek Harness 的已归档会话加一个真正可用的「删除」：连同它启动过的子代理会话，一起从磁盘移除。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```powershell"
    },
    {
      "section": "npm",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add @angela_lwh/dsh-archive-purge"
    },
    {
      "section": "GitHub",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add https://github.com/Angela-lwh/dsh-archive-purge\n```\n\n装完重启 DSH：宿主半在启动时加载，之后已归档会话的行内 `...` 菜单和悬停区会出现「删除会话」。"
    },
    {
      "section": "限制",
      "text": "- 只能删除**已归档**的会话，未归档请先归档。\n- 会话本身或它启动的子代理有任务在跑时拒绝；宿主仍持有该会话时先登记，下次启动或点「完成待删除清理」时完成。\n- 删除不可逆、不进回收站；附件（跨会话共享）不动。删除会话时一并清掉它的 spill 溢出目录和投影缓存记录，历史遗留的孤儿缓存记录也会被顺手清掉（`sweepCache: false` 可关）。\n- 子代理会话随父会话一起删除；父会话已不存在的遗留子代理，会在启动或下一次删除时自动清扫。\n- 从未发过消息的空白会话（侧边栏本就不显示）**满 24 小时**后才会在启动、新建会话或任意一次删除时自动清理（`blankMinAgeMs` 可调），也不会再出现在 `@` 里；**对话框里还留着未发送草稿的会话永远不会被清理**（浏览器半会把有草稿的会话 id 报给宿主并落盘）。`sweepBlanks` / `filterBlankReferences` 可分别关闭这两项。\n- 浏览器端带一个「长时间挂起后自动重连」的兜底：连接没有心跳，笔记本休眠会让 WebSocket 半开，工作区快照停在旧状态（表现为新会话显示「未分组」、选择器里缺工作区）；页面空闲 30 分钟后的第一次操作会重连一次，重新拉取投影。\n- 只作用于本机 `$DSH_HOME/sessions`，删之前建议自行备份。"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-archive-purge",
      "text": "**English** | [中文](README.md)\n\nA real \"delete\" for archived DeepSeek Harness sessions: removes the session and any subagent sessions it spawned from disk."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```powershell"
    },
    {
      "section": "npm",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add @angela_lwh/dsh-archive-purge"
    },
    {
      "section": "GitHub",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add https://github.com/Angela-lwh/dsh-archive-purge\n```\n\nRestart DSH afterwards: the Host half loads at startup, and an archived session's `...` menu and hover strip then show **Delete session**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Limits",
      "text": "- Only **archived** sessions can be deleted; archive one first.\n- Refused while the session, or one of its subagent sessions, has work in progress; a session the Host still holds is staged and finished at the next start or from \"Finish pending deletions\".\n- Deletion is irreversible and there is no trash; attachments (shared across sessions) are untouched. A deleted Session's spill overflow and projection-cache record go with it, and cache records left by earlier deletions are swept too (`sweepCache: false` turns that off).\n- Subagent sessions are deleted with their parent; leftovers whose parent is already gone are swept at startup or on the next deletion.\n- Blank sessions that never sent a message (the sidebar hides them) are removed automatically once they are **24 hours old** — on Host start, on a new conversation, or on any deletion (`blankMinAgeMs` tunes that) — and no longer show up in `@`; **a Session whose composer still holds an unsent draft is never swept** (the browser half reports those Session ids to the Host, which persists them). `sweepBlanks` / `filterBlankReferences` switch each part off.\n- The browser half carries one workaround: the connection has no heartbeat, s"
    }
  ],
